'''Haitian Baliscans''' ({{langx|bl|Haitiano-Baliscanos}}) are [[Baliscans]] of Haitian descent or [[Haiti]]-born people who reside in [[Balisca]]. As of 2025, more than 75% of Haitian Baliscans reside in [[Pindorama]], specifically the region of [[Catanduva]].

